\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Mass-accretion-rate diagnostic from same-\texttt  {TrackId} Warren-corrected FOF histories. The plotted quantity is \(\Gamma =d\ln M/d\ln a\), measured between adjacent snapshots for present-day FOF halos in four \(z=0\) mass bins. The upper row uses the raw adjacent same-\texttt  {TrackId} FOF masses, while the lower row uses a cumulative maximum envelope to reduce the effect of temporary FOF mass decreases. Lines show median \(\Gamma \), and shaded regions show the 16th--84th percentile range. The x-axis is redshift, decreasing toward the right.}}{10}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:mass_accretion_rate_trackid}{{6}{10}{Mass-accretion-rate diagnostic from same-\texttt {TrackId} Warren-corrected FOF histories. The plotted quantity is \(\Gamma =d\ln M/d\ln a\), measured between adjacent snapshots for present-day FOF halos in four \(z=0\) mass bins. The upper row uses the raw adjacent same-\texttt {TrackId} FOF masses, while the lower row uses a cumulative maximum envelope to reduce the effect of temporary FOF mass decreases. Lines show median \(\Gamma \), and shaded regions show the 16th--84th percentile range. The x-axis is redshift, decreasing toward the right}{figure.6}{}}
